# Full-resolution art downloads (art.py prepares them into assets/paintings) and the 2048 px originals it keeps.
assets/paintings_hires/
assets/paintings/_2048/
# The Classical Hall casts' raw scans and converted meshes (re-fetch and convert with classical_art.py; the imported assets are in Content).
assets/classical/*.stl
assets/classical/*.glb
# The Élan Cube's Matterhorn: swisstopo and Copernicus raw downloads and the built terrain (journey_terrain.py re-fetches and rebuilds them).
windows/SourceArt/Journeys/Matterhorn/raw/
windows/SourceArt/Journeys/Matterhorn/terrain/
